$ABEG$ and $ABCK$ are parallelograms, so $GE=KC=AB=3$ and $DK=4-3=1$. Since $FG\parallel DK$, triangles $AFG$ and $ADK$ are similar with ratio $\dfrac{AF}{AD}=\dfrac{15}{31}$, so $FG=\dfrac{15}{31}\cdot1=\dfrac{15}{31}$. Therefore
