With thickness $1$, the volumes of the pieces equal the areas of the triangles:
\[
[ABC]=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot6\cdot2\sqrt3=6\sqrt3,\qquad [ACP]=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot4\cdot2\sqrt3=4\sqrt3,\qquad [APD]=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot2\cdot2\sqrt3=2\sqrt3 .
