\dfrac{\sqrt3}{4}s^2=435600\ \Longrightarrow\ s^2=\dfrac{1742400}{\sqrt3}=\dfrac{1320^2}{\sqrt3}\ \Longrightarrow\ s=\dfrac{1320}{\sqrt[4]{3}}\approx\boxed{1003\text{ feet}}.
