In the first, the half-base is $15$ and the altitude is $\sqrt{25^2-15^2}=20$; in the second, the half-base is $20$ and the altitude is $\sqrt{25^2-20^2}=15$. Both are made of two $15$-$20$-$25$ right triangles, so
\[
